# Version 7 · fast and relentless (the 808 flavour)
title: Do Not Be Afraid
subtitle: Version 7 · Relentless
tempo: 129
key: C minor
music: relentless
intensity: 1
grade: ember
images: ../assets/img/{}-2.webp
endnote: "Here I am! I stand at the door and knock."
endref: Revelation 3:20

@0:00-0:01.5 black cue:build,0.6
@0:01.5-0:04 img:light ken:push hit:1
title: Overflowing
@0:04-0:08 img:child ken:up cue:tense,0.7
vo: Before anything was made, there was love.
@0:08-0:11 img:steps ken:push
text: Not a little.
text: Not enough.
@0:11-0:15 img:turn ken:in
vo: For the lost. For the misguided. For the ones who would wound Him.
@0:15-0:18 img:smile ken:still hold:silent
@0:18-0:22 img:hands ken:slow fx:dove cue:tense,0.9
title: What He holds.
@0:22-0:23.5 drop:"Light." ref:"John 1:5"
@0:23.5-0:28 img:kneel ken:in cue:war,0.7
vo: "Whoever causes one of these little ones to stumble..."
ref: Matthew 18:6
@0:28-0:32 img:millstone ken:down
text: A millstone. / The depths of the sea.
@0:32-0:36 img:door ken:push
vo: "I never knew you."
ref: Matthew 7:23
@0:36-0:37.5 drop:"Truth." ref:"John 8:32"
@0:37.5-0:41 img:market ken:left cue:tense,1
text: Our struggle is not / against flesh and blood.
ref: Ephesians 6:12
@0:41-0:44 img:temple ken:right cue:build
text: Do not bargain with darkness.
@0:44-0:46 img:take ken:push
title: Drive it out.
@0:46-0:49 cuts:cords,knot,knot!,eyes,braid,whip cue:war
text: He made a whip of cords.
ref: John 2:15
@0:49-0:53 img:tables ken:push hit:2
text: Overturn the tables / in your own heart.
@0:53-0:57 img:doves ken:up fx:flare cue:choir
text: We do not fight people.
text: We fight for them.
@0:57-1:00 img:whipfloor ken:still
title: Love is not weak.
@1:00-1:01.5 drop:"Overcome." ref:"John 16:33"
@1:01.5-1:06 img:weep ken:slow cue:weep
vo: He wept over the city that did not recognize the time of God's coming.
ref: Luke 19:41–44
@1:06-1:08 img:stone ken:push hit:2 cue:war,0.8
@1:08-1:12 img:ruins ken:left
text: Not one stone / left on another.
ref: Matthew 24:2 · 70 AD
@1:12-1:16 img:redsea ken:in
text: The Lord will fight for you.
ref: Exodus 14:14
@1:16-1:17.5 drop:"Love." ref:"John 15:13"
@1:17.5-1:28 img:grown ken:in cue:heart
text: I will not fear.
text: Fear makes the soul small.
text: Let it come.
text: Let it pass through me.
text: Only He remains.
@1:28-1:31 img:eyesopen ken:still hold:silent
@1:31-1:37 img:stand ken:up fx:rise cue:tutti
vo: "Do not fear, for I am with you. I will uphold you with my righteous right hand."
ref: Isaiah 41:10
@1:37-1:40 img:crowd ken:drift cue:war
text: We love people.
@1:40-1:43 img:kneel ken:push
text: We protect them.
@1:43-1:47 img:turn ken:in
text: We introduce them / to Jesus Christ.
@1:47-1:48.5 drop:"The Way." ref:"John 14:6"
@1:48.5-1:53 cuts:light,doves,rise,dawn cue:tutti
title: Do not bargain with darkness.
@1:53-1:57 img:courage ken:push
title: Drive it out.
@1:57-2:01 img:beauty ken:up
text: Do not be overcome by evil,
text: overcome evil with good.
ref: Romans 12:21
@2:01-2:05 img:dawn ken:push hit:2
title: So stand.
@2:05-2:12 img:opendoor ken:in fade cue:outro
text: You were never forced.
text: You were invited.
@2:12-2:18 black
title: Do not be afraid.
